WEBVTT

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:31.056
will also have a fun time,

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.456
then that's enough for us.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:34.496
And I think, as adults, we need to learn

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.976
that there's no right
or wrong way to play.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.216
Thank you very much.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:42.079
(Applause)